cio, sino de una relación extraconyugal de Miriam con otro hombre, Federico Ansola. María Antonieta fallece después de un tiempo y su hija queda totalmente sola. Por suerte para ella, Chabela Soriano, una vieja amiga de su madre, la hospeda en su casa junto a sus dos hijos." type="episode" contentRating="M/16" duration="3600000" grandparentArt="https://img.static-ottera.com/prod/cis/video/thumbnails/widescreen/3840x2160/vmuf-thum-wide.jpg" grandparentGuid="plex://show/6882d23f2bdc7b90d86a0f71" grandparentKey="/library/metadata/6882d23f2bdc7b90d86a0f71" grandparentRatingKey="6882d23f2bdc7b90d86a0f71" grandparentThumb="https://img.static-ottera.com/prod/cis/show/thumbnails/widescreen/2000x2858/vmuf-thum-wide_0.jpg" grandparentTitle="Mundo de Fieras" grandparentType="show" index="95" originallyAvailableAt="2026-05-11T00:00:00Z" parentIndex="1" requiresConsent="1" skipParent="1" thumb="https://img.static-ottera.com/prod/cis/video/thumbnails/widescreen/3840x2160/vmuf-thum-wide.jpg" title="Episodio 223" userState="0" year="2026"><Image alt="Episodio 223" type="coverArt" url="https://img.static-ottera.com/prod/cis/video/thumbnails/widescreen/3840x2160/vmuf-thum-wide.jpg"/><Image alt="Episodio 223" type="coverPoster" url="https://img.static-ottera.com/prod/cis/show/thumbnails/widescreen/2000x2858/vmuf-thum-wide_0.jpg"/><Image alt="Episodio 223" type="snapshot" url="https://img.static-ottera.com/prod/cis/video/thumbnails/widescreen/3840x2160/vmuf-thum-wide.jpg"/><Genre filter="genre=6171e01d4c451f5a44debdf6" id="6171e01d4c451f5a44debdf6" key="/library/sections/home/all?genre=6171e01d4c451f5a44debdf6" ratingKey="genre_6171e01d4c451f5a44debdf6" slug="en-espanol" tag="En Español" type="directory" context="tag.genre"/><Media beginsAt="1780974000" duration="3600000" endsAt="1780977600" id="6a1e25458907dc3c7000c15c" onAir="0" premiere="0" videoResolution="720" origin="livetv"/><Media beginsAt="1780995600" duration="3600000" endsAt="1780999200" id="6a1e25458907dc3c7000c162" onAir="